Usage: agent-deck feedback agent-consent [--off]

Let agent sessions on this machine file issues and answers on GitHub with
--from-agent. It shows what is posted, where and as which GitHub account, then
asks y/N (default N); y sets [feedback] agent_reports = true in config.toml.
Until then --from-agent refuses with consent_required (--yes does not stand in).
Turning it on needs a terminal on stdin: a piped answer is refused with
confirm_required and nothing changes.

Flags:
  --off   turn agent reports off again
